WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.192
A calm haircut for adults. Here is how to make it work.

2
00:00:06.192 --> 00:00:12.168
Book the first slot of the day. The salon is quietest then.

3
00:00:12.168 --> 00:00:18.768
Say exactly what we want: number three at the sides, scissors on top.

4
00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:25.272
Saying it the same way each time works. The barber remembers too.

5
00:00:25.272 --> 00:00:32.496
Clippers buzz. We can ask for scissors only, if buzzing is too much.

6
00:00:32.496 --> 00:00:39.024
We can ask for breaks at any point. The barber is used to it.

7
00:00:39.024 --> 00:00:45.672
No small talk is needed. Quiet haircuts are normal haircuts.

8
00:00:45.672 --> 00:00:51.216
We pay, book the next one for the same slot, and leave.

9
00:00:51.216 --> 00:00:59.424
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

